      "Episode 01 picks up as the rescue team moves through Chernobog, which is still occupied by Reunion. Speculation (no source found yet): The team notices a metallic smell and an unnaturally dark sky, both signs of an imminent Catastrophe. The Catastrophe strikes the city, destroys much of it, and spreads Oripathy, an incurable disease caused by the Originium it leaves behind.",
      "Before the team can get clear, Reunion fighters and their leader, Talulah, intercept them. Talulah is a Draco, and her blazing Flame Arts can melt the buildings around her. Speculation (no source found yet): She says her goal was met the moment the Catastrophe struck, and she wants ordinary people to suffer the disease and persecution that the Infected have endured for ages.",
