      "Reunion's Assault Squad, led by Skullshatterer, is searching the same slums. Under Talulah's orders, the squad is trying to recover one of the keys to Chernobog's control systems. Skullshatterer finds Misha in an abandoned building first, but Rhodes Island gets to her and hands her over to the L.G.D. Skullshatterer vows to crush them, and he sets an ambush in an alley.",
