      "Rhodes Island and the Lungmen Guard Department pursue the retreating Reunion fighters through the wilderness on the Yan-Ursus border. Speculation (no source found yet): Penguin Logistics, including Texas and Exusiai, joins the pursuit, and its goal is to slow the retreat and arrest them. After escaping the pursuit, Skullshatterer meets Misha in the wilderness. W had brought her to him. Misha realizes he is her brother Alex, whom she had believed dead during the persecution in Ursus. Skullshatterer insists that Alex is already dead. He asks Misha to fight for the Infected at his side, and he teaches her to use his Originium grenade launchers.",
